What:		/sys/class/leds/asus::keyboard/
What:		/sys/class/leds/asus::lightbar/
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Marco Scardovi <scardracs@disroot.org>
Contact:	Denis Benato <denis.benato@linux.dev>
Description:	ASUS Aura keyboard and chassis lightbar Dynamic Lighting nodes.
		Each node accepts its own effect, palette, and direct RGB
		writes. Firmware effects, including static color, are
		committed with Aura 0xb3/0xb5/0xb4 so the controller keeps
		them across reboot. Brightness does not rewrite that packet
		and does not gate the zone: on asus::keyboard it is the
		firmware backlight, and the lightbar has no separate dimmer.
		enabled gates the zone with the power command. The logo
		tracks the keyboard power states. The lightbar node is absent
		when the device has no chassis lightbar.
